  "id": "BIT-mongodb-2026-13062",
  "summary": "MongoDB mongos Improper Validation of Internal Flags in Queryable Encryption Write Commands on Sharded Clusters",
  "details": "An authenticated user with write privileges on a Queryable Encryption-enabled collection may be able to modify internal encryption metadata fields that are intended to be server-controlled, by sending crafted write commands through the mongos router on a sharded cluster. This can result in corruption of encrypted query correctness.",
